            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.6</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Scanning now shows what it is doing, in the middle of the window: which
      stage it is at, how many files it has been through, how much has been
      copied in. You can hide it and carry on &#8212; it keeps going.</li>
  <li>Fixed: finishing a scan re-ran part of the app's start-up instead of
      simply refreshing the list.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
